<div class="p-8 text-gray-200">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Corp</h1>
  <p class="mb-6 text-gray-400">
    Alliance identity and management. Everything here is off by default and turned on one
    feature at a time by an operator — a card marked "not enabled" is a deployment setting,
    not a missing feature.
  </p>

  <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="border border-gray-700 rounded p-4" id="corp-card-identity">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Your identity</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
        Pick which of your characters is your main. Your main's corporation decides your
        state (member / blue / guest), and your state decides what you can reach here.
        Nothing else in this suite works until you set one.
      </p>
      <.link navigate={~p"/corp/identity"} class="btn btn-sm">
        Open
      </.link>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-gray-700 rounded p-4" id="corp-card-roster">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Corp roster</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
        Every character in the corp with last login, last logout, location and ship —
        including people who have never opened this app. Sourced from one director-scoped
        ESI call, so it needs a director to have granted access.
      </p>
      <.link :if={@corp_flags[:corp_roster_enabled?]} navigate={~p"/corp/roster"} class="btn btn-sm">
        Open
      </.link>
      <span :if={not @corp_flags[:corp_roster_enabled?]} class="text-xs text-gray-500">
        Not enabled — set WANDERER_CORP_ROSTER
      </span>
    </div>

    <div :if={@is_corp_admin?} class="border border-gray-700 rounded p-4" id="corp-card-map-grants">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Map access grants</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
        Give a group a role on a map's access list once, and membership of that group
        grants and revokes map access automatically — no hand-maintained ACLs. Admin only.
      </p>
      <.link
        :if={@corp_flags[:group_map_sync_enabled?]}
        navigate={~p"/corp/map-grants"}
        class="btn btn-sm"
      >
        Open
      </.link>
      <span :if={not @corp_flags[:group_map_sync_enabled?]} class="text-xs text-gray-500">
        Not enabled — set WANDERER_GROUP_MAP_SYNC
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p :if={not @is_corp_admin?} class="mt-6 text-xs text-gray-500">
    Some pages here are admin-only and are not listed for you.
  </p>
</div>
